cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Flicker: a reproducible search for uncatalogued photometric anomalies in TESS Sector 103"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-06
authors:
  - family-names: Odorico
    given-names: Filippo
    affiliation: VDX Research
repository-code: "https://github.com/NOME-ORGANIZZAZIONE/vdx-research-tess"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - astronomy
  - TESS
  - light curves
  - anomaly detection
  - eclipsing binaries
abstract: >-
  Reproducible pipeline that searches 12,995 TESS Sector 103 light curves for
  anomalous objects not yet catalogued, with documented artifact rejection,
  catalogue cross-match and multi-sector persistence checks. Results are
  candidates for verification, not discoveries.